    "media:imagetext": "727-200\nIMPORTANT INFORMATION\nFOR OUR 727 FANJET PASSENGERS\nEMERGENCY EXITS\nThere are eight exits provided for your use. The chart below will\nshow you the one closest to your seat. The exits over the wings\nare removable windows. The two exits forward and the two side\nexits aft are doors which are equipped with fast operating\nevacuation slides.\nFWD CABIN DOORS\nFWD\nENTRY\nDOOR (LH Side)\nAND\nFWD\nGALLEY\nDOOR (RH Side)\nCLOSED\nROTATE\nHANDLE IN\nDIRECTION\nOF ARROW\nAND PUSH\nDOOR OUT\nOPEN\nSLIDE\nSTEP 1\nWINDOW EXITS\nSTEP 2\nPULL\nDOWN\nTHIS\nFLAP\nGRASP\nHANDLE\nAND\nPULL\nDOWN\nPULL\nTOP\nINWARD\nAND\nLIFT\nAFT SERVICE DOORS\nAFT\nSERVICE\nDOOR\n(LH and RH Side)\nPULL\nOUT\nHANDLE\nAND\nROTATE 180°\nPUSH\nDOOR\nOUT\nOPEN\nCLOSED\nSLIDE\nEMERGENCY EXITS\nENTRY\nDOOR\nAND 4\nESCAPE\nSLIDE\nGALLEY\nSERVICE\nDOOR\nAND\nESCAPE\nSLIDE\nWINDOW\nEXITS\nWINDOW\nLEXITS\nSERVICE\nDOOR\nBAND\nESCAPE\nSLIDE I\nSERVICE\nDOOR\nBAND\nESCAPE\nSLIDE\n*\n*REAR CABIN DOOR USED\nONLY AT DIRECTION OF\nFLIGHT CREW.\nPLACARDS GIVING\nSTEPS\nFOR OPERATION\nOF\nEVACUATION SLIDE\nARE LOCATED ON EACH\nDOOR. SLIDE IS SHOWN\nREADY FOR USE.\nPLEASE DO NOT REMOVE FROM AIRCRAFT\nSee Reverse Side\n2007.011.068",
